{{Quote|I had a sort of instinctive take on what [Thrawn] was about, and I think David [Filoni] just liked that.|Lars Mikkelson, on how he was cast as Thrawn|<ref name="YT">{{YouTube|video=xhT7nmiRqoU|text=Everything Geek Podcast Special Guest Interview- Lars Mikkelsen|channel=@EverythingGeekPodCast|name=Everything Geek Cast|date=2016-11-10|archivedate=20200803054419}} {{C|at 5m15s}}</ref>}}
'''Lars Mikkelsen''' (born [[May 6]], [[1960s#1964|1964]]<ref name="New-SW" />) is a [[Wikipedia:Denmark|Danish]] actor who provided the voice of [[Grand Admiral]] [[Mitth'raw'nuruodo|Thrawn]] in ''[[Star Wars Rebels]]'',<ref name="Live Stream" /> and portrays the character in live-action in the ''[[Star Wars: Ahsoka]]'' television series.<ref name="Twitter">{{Twitter|username=starwars|name=[[Star Wars]]|url=status/1644657581833453568|archivedate=1644657581833453568|quote=Lars Mikkelsen joins the cast of
@AhsokaOfficial as Grand Admiral Thrawn. #Ahsoka}}</ref> He is the older brother of [[Mads Mikkelsen]], who portrayed [[Galen Walton Erso]] in ''[[Rogue One: A Star Wars Story]]''.<ref name="Live Stream">{{SWYouTube|0EI8YxV0u2U|Star Wars Celebration Europe 2016 Live Stream – Day 2 &#124; The Star Wars Show LIVE!}}</ref>

